OL,3,GNEWSACharity aims to make 'healthier
OL,4,Abehaviours easier'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report focused on healthy
OL,7,Fnutrition, physical activity, healthier
OL,8,Fweight, substance use and said 301
OL,9,Freferrals had been made to Bailiwick
OL,10,FSocial Prescribing, with link workers
OL,11,Fmaking more than 1,000 referrals into
OL,12,Fcommunity activities and support
OL,13,Fservices.
OL,15,FCommission chief executive Dr Simon
OL,16,FSebire said: "Health improvement is
OL,17,Fabout creating, environments and
OL,18,Fsystems that make every day healthier
OL,19,Fbehaviours easier."
